TYPES.md §9.2, §1: a refused map key type (E3011) is not judged again at the keys of its literal:
no E2102 or E3027 for `it` or a name in scope after it.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local enum F { x, y }

local let s: String = "a"

local let bad: {F?: Int} = { it: 1, s: 2 }
